IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-HARVARD-1946-BIQUINARY.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-CHATTER-FAULT-FLAG PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-RELAY-INPUT-SHADOW.
   05 D1-DECIMAL-DIGIT-IN  PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-SHADOW-DIGIT-SNAP PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 D2-BIQUINARY-STAGE.
   05 D2-BI-RELAY-ACTIVE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D2-QUIN-RELAY-ACTIVE PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-TOTAL-ACTIVE-BITS PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-STATE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 0 TO D0-CHATTER-FAULT-FLAG.
    MOVE 7 TO D1-DECIMAL-DIGIT-IN.

    PERFORM STAGE-BIQUINARY-ENCODING.
    PERFORM APPLY-DROP-OUT-LATCH.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.

    IF D2-TOTAL-ACTIVE-BITS == 2 AND D1-SHADOW-DIGIT-SNAP == D1-DECIMAL-DIGIT-IN
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 3 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

STAGE-BIQUINARY-ENCODING.
    MOVE D1-DECIMAL-DIGIT-IN TO D1-SHADOW-DIGIT-SNAP.
    MOVE 1 TO D2-BI-RELAY-ACTIVE.
    MOVE 1 TO D2-QUIN-RELAY-ACTIVE.
    COMPUTE D2-TOTAL-ACTIVE-BITS = D2-BI-RELAY-ACTIVE + D2-QUIN-RELAY-ACTIVE.
    EXIT.

APPLY-DROP-OUT-LATCH.
    IF D0-CHATTER-FAULT-FLAG == 1
        MOVE D1-SHADOW-DIGIT-SNAP TO D2-COMMITTED-STATE
    ELSE
        MOVE D1-DECIMAL-DIGIT-IN TO D2-COMMITTED-STATE
    END-IF.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-STATE - ((D2-COMMITTED-STATE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
